flowchart LR
  P["Prefill<br/>whole prompt in parallel<br/>compute bound"] --> KV[("KV cache<br/>in HBM")]
  KV --> D["Decode step<br/>read active weights + KV<br/>to emit one token"]
  D --> TOK["Token"]
  TOK -->|append, repeat| D
  D -.-> X["Low arithmetic intensity<br/>cores wait on HBM"]
  X -.-> L["Levers: batching · prompt caching<br/>disaggregated prefill/decode<br/>shorter context"]
